# CCO No Drive Links — Import Only Rule

CCO must NOT use Google Drive links as the final workflow. Google Drive is only:

- migration source
- source archive
- provenance metadata

The final CCO product must store and display ALL patient files directly inside CCO.

## Hard rule

**No patient file may remain link-only in the final CCO UI.**

End goal: `link_only_files = 0`. Staff shall never need Google Drive in daily work.

## Use old CCO first

The old CCO design already contains important journal/file/image work. Before building new import logic, inspect and reuse:

- old CCO patient-file mappings
- old CCO journal-PDF imports
- old CCO image/photo flow
- old CCO Drive/Meridiq mappings
- old CCO file classifications
- old CCO timeline linkage

**Do NOT start from scratch if old CCO already solved part of the mapping.**

## Destination — CCO secure storage

All patient files must be imported into CCO secure storage:

- journal-PDFs
- bilder (alla)
- före/efter-foton
- konsultationsfoton
- operationsfoton
- uppföljningsfoton
- samtycken
- signerade avtal
- hälsodeklarationer
- friskförsäkran
- Aisia-rapporter
- historiska Meridiq/Drive-dokument

## Provenance

Keep original source metadata **only** as internal metadata:

- `originalDriveFileId`
- `originalDrivePath`
- `originalFileName`
- `sourceSystem`
- `importRunId`

Do NOT expose Drive as the working UI.

## GitHub safety

**Never commit patient data to GitHub:**

- no journals
- no patient images
- no personnummer
- no signed agreements
- no health declarations
- no raw patient-PDFs
- no identifiable exports
- no file manifests with patient names/personnummer

**GitHub MAY contain:**

- import code
- schemas
- migration scripts
- anonymized test fixtures
- template registry
- QA rules + reports without patient data
- documentation

## Required import validation

Every imported file MUST have:

- CCO asset id
- patientId or review status
- storageKey
- checksum/hash (SHA-256)
- file size
- mime type
- category
- sourceSystem
- importedAt
- verification status
- audit requirement

## Required statuses (state machine)

```
DISCOVERED              fil hittad i source
IMPORTING               paagaende kopiering till CCO storage
IMPORTED_TO_CCO         fil i CCO storage, checksum verifierad
VERIFIED_IN_CCO         manuellt eller auto-verifierad mot original
VISIBLE_ON_PATIENT_CARD kopplad till patient + visas i UI
NEEDS_REVIEW            osaker patient-koppling -> review queue
REJECTED                review-beslut: inte denna patient
DUPLICATE               samma checksum som annan asset
FAILED_IMPORT           tekniskt fel vid import
LINK_ONLY_BLOCKER       fortfarande bara lank - BLOCKER till cutover
```

## Foerbjudet

- Drive-laenkar i slut-UI
- "Oeppna i Drive"-floeden som standard
- Patientdata i GitHub
- Patient-PDFs / bilder / journaler i GitHub
- Low-confidence-filer auto-kopplas (kraever review)
- Filer markeras klara utan checksum/verifiering
- Auto-merge utan review

