## Pipeline (in order)

1. **Discover** — laes gamla CCO file records, gamla CCO patient-file mappings, gamla CCO journal-PDF-importer, gamla CCO bildfloede, Meridiq-export, Drive (endast daer gamla CCO saknar binaer)
2. **Download** — ladda ner / kopiera binaer till CCO secure storage
3. **Checksum** — SHA-256
4. **Verify** — bekraefta att fil i storage matchar source
5. **Classify** — kategorisera (journal / photo_X / consent / agreement / form)
6. **Link patient** — koppla till patient via heuristik
7. **Link encounter** — koppla till encounter via datum + behandling
8. **Index** — patient_assets-record
9. **Audit-log** — import-event
10. **Show** — visa i CCO patient-card UI
11. **Timeline** — laegg tidslinjehaendelse paa patient
12. **Provenance bevarad** — originalDriveFileId / originalDrivePath sparas som metadata
13. **Review queue** — osaekra -> NEEDS_REVIEW (aldrig auto-merge)

## QA-dashboard ska visa

- Total files discovered
- Total files imported to CCO storage
- Total files verified
- **Total link-only files (maal: 0)**
- Total files needing review
- Total files failed import
- Total patients with complete file history
- Total patients with missing journal-PDFs
- Total patients with missing images
- Total orphan files (utan patient-koppling)
- Total duplicate files (samma checksum)

## Completion criteria

The migration is **NOT complete** until ALL of:

- `link_only_files = 0`
- All verified source files imported to CCO storage
- All files have checksum/hash
- All files have category
- All files are attached to patient or in review queue
- Staff can open journal-files directly inside CCO
- Staff can open images directly inside CCO
- Staff does NOT need Google Drive in daily work
- No patient data exists in GitHub

## Cutover gates

**Cliento faar fasas ut naer:**
- All ovanstaaende PLUS
- Bokningssystem fungerar i CCO

**Meridiq faar fasas ut naer:**
- All ovanstaaende PLUS
- Ny journalfoering direkt i CCO i 30 dagar utan att personalen oeppnat Meridiq

